{"id": "34360", "title": "婚礼", "author": "岑凯伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 80, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34360.htm", "intro": "琪莉，聪明美丽，柔情似水，从国外留学归来，继承了父亲留下的巨大产业，一时成为香港男士名流追求的豪门丽人。 \r\n　　文瑞，是一位年轻有为，风度翩翩的多情的白马王子。 \r\n　　若梦，光彩照人，美丽娇艳，但性情狡诈。这薄命女是琪莉中学时代的好友。 \r\n　　金振，这是一个狂赌烂嫖，五毒俱全的社会浪人，犯有前科，蹲过监狱。 \r\n　　《婚礼》紧紧围绕着这几个人物的命运和他们之间错综复杂的关系，叙述了一个激情愤涌而又哀怨婉约的爱情故事……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34360", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2183280.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2183281.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2183282.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2183283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2183284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2183285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2183286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2183287.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2183288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2183289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2183290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2183291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2183292.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2183293.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2183294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2183295.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2183296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2183297.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2183298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2183299.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2183300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2183301.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2183302.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2183303.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2183304.htm